JULinux 13X -- Licenses & Credits
=================================

JULinux is built from build files based on eznixOS 13X by eznix (and on
StormD by Ben Fitzpatrick). The build script (bljulinux13X) carries
eznix's original license header, reproduced here together with his
disclaimer, re-included verbatim:

    bldeznix13X -- Revision: 13X -- by eznix (https://sourceforge.net/projects/eznixos/)
    (GNU/General Public License version 3.0)

